[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0180","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0180.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0204","title":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trend Micro OfficeScan Corporate Edition 3.0/3.5/3.11/3.13 版本的客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统的 12345 端口建立 5 个 HTTP 连接，导致 CPU 利用率升至 100%，造成服务不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0204"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Trend Micro 已发布针对 OfficeScan 3.5 的补丁程序（ofce_patch_35.htm），建议升级至修复版本。若无法升级，应在网络边界防火墙中限制端口 12345 仅允许受信 IP 访问，或禁用 OfficeScan 客户端的远程管理监听功能，防止外部攻击者利用此漏洞耗尽 CPU 资源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0340.html","http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1013","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=D129BBE1730AD2118A0300805FC1C2FE038AF28B%40209-76-212-10.trendmicro.com"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0180.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0606","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0187","title":"Alex Heiphetz Group eZshopper loadpage.cgi 目录遍历与远程命令执行漏洞","description":"EZShopper 3.0 的 loadpage.cgi CGI 脚本存在目录遍历和远程命令执行漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 loadpage.cgi 传入包含 `..` 序列的路径参数遍历服务器目录，读取任意文件；或通过注入 shell 元字符执行系统命令。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，可导致敏感信息泄露和服务器被完全控制，影响 EZShopper 3.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0187"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 EZShopper 3.0，将该软件从服务器彻底卸载或下线，因其已停止维护且无法获取安全更新。如暂无法下线，请在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问控制规则，禁止外部访问 loadpage.cgi 脚本，并删除或重命名该文件以阻断利用路径。同时检查服务器是否存在 webshell 等后门文件，必要时重建服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0356.html","http://