 EZShopper 3.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0188"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11Z","remediation":"立即升级 EZShopper 至最新版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。如无法升级，请从服务器移除或重命名 search.cgi 脚本，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 mod_rewrite 或 .htaccess）限制对该脚本的访问，仅允许授信 IP 段请求。同时确保 Web 服务器以低权限用户运行，禁用 CGI 目录的执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0356.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1014","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0188.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0188","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0188.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0188.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7fv-g54q-h3xf/GHSA-r7fv-g54q-h3xf.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/1e259307452fa6083f86403d8e77caee7006ff5d/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iisprotect_sql_injection.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/E/ezshopper.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0184","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0209","title":"Lynx 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Lynx 2.x 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在恶意网页中构造超长 URL 链接，诱使 Lynx 用户访问后触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致浏览器程序崩溃，甚至可能以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞利用无需认证，但需要用户交互（点击恶意链接），影响 Lynx 2.x 全系列版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0209"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Lynx 至官方修复版本，该版本已修复 URL 长度校验不严导致的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可限制用户仅访问受信任站点，或使用 w3m 等替代浏览器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1012"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0184.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0149","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0170","title":"Linux man 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中的 man 帮助程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 MANPAGER 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致以 man 组权限（egid 15）执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 RedHat 6.1 等 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用方式为本地触发，无需目标系统开启网络服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0170"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08Z","remediation":"升级 RedHat 6.1 的 man 程序包至修复版本（如 man-1.5i-4），或直接升级至受支持的 RedHat Enterprise Linux 现代版本（RHEL 7/8/9）。如无法升级系统，可临时移除 man 命令的 SGID 权限（chmod g-s /usr/bin/man），并在 /etc/profile 中全局禁止通过 MANPAGER 环境变量传递恶意参数，同时限制不可信用户的本地 shell 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1011","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/255","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0170.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/75714a8ac899a2d78a02cc77946dc01b2cac6c38/2000/CVE-2000-0170.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2000/CVE-2000-0170/paper.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0170","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/9c403f53c634b5fba65371b2388288bf1d7f551e/2000/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0170.json","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2000/database/CVE-2000-0170/README.md","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2000/CVE-2000-0170.json","https://github.com/CVEhive/CVEhive/blob/b9915233fd01050601434cf4b7a2b0f95536073b/data/CVE-2022-31813/repo/2000/CVE-2000-0170/paper.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/mike182/exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0149.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0149.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0149.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0196","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0221","title":"Nortel Nautica Marlin SNMP 服务 UDP 数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Nortel Nautica Marlin 桥接设备的 SNMP 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备 SNMP 端口（UDP 161）发送零长度 UDP 数据包，触发 SNMP 服务进程崩溃，导致设备拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Nortel Nautica Marlin 系列桥接设备，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0221"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15Z","remediation":"升级 Nortel Nautica Marlin 设备固件至最新版本；如无法升级，可在设备 ACL 中限制 SNMP 端口 (UDP 161) 仅允许信任源 IP 访问，或在边界防火墙上过滤发往该端口的零长度 UDP 数据包。如业务不需要 SNMP 管理，建议直接关闭 SNMP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securit