 进程向 Zone Labs 服务器（zones.zonelabs.com）发送明文 HTTP 请求，改用加密通道传输敏感系统与网络信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0220.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0220","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e6a2c88657ae90cd7ad32328e40c3e9d3c5f5451/2000/CVE-2000-0220.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0220.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xc4x-697w-hrmr/GHSA-xc4x-697w-hrmr.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0220.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88311/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/4741b68d7df3ee95f92711bd26337adccd49bef2/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0192","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0192.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0217","title":"OpenSSH X11 转发会话劫持漏洞","description":"SSH 客户端默认配置启用了 X11 转发功能，当用户使用 SSH 连接到攻击者控制的恶意服务器时，服务器端可通过恶意的 xauth 程序劫持客户端的 X11 会话，进而捕获键盘输入、窃取屏幕内容或执行任意 X 窗口操作。攻击条件简单，仅需诱导受害者连接至恶意 SSH 服务器即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0217"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14Z","remediation":"修改 SSH 客户端配置文件 `~/.ssh/config` 或系统级 `/etc/ssh/ssh_config`，将 `ForwardX11` 设为 `no` 以禁用 X11 转发；同时升级 OpenSSH 到 4.0 以上版本（该版本默认已关闭 X11 转发），并确保 `xauth` 程序位于可信路径且权限为 755。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1006","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0217.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0217","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0217.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0217.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6hfg-9p4g-2q8c/GHSA-6hfg-9p4g-2q8c.json","https://github.com/djc/oxish/blob/bf64cf02d5e31a17e708d69e2e0f66422499f851/openssh-vulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_123.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001190.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0192.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0189","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0189.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0214","title":"FTPx FTP Explorer 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"FTPx FTP Explorer 1.0.00.10 版本存在弱密码加密漏洞。该软件在存储 FTP 站点的用户名、密码及配置文件时使用了弱加密算法，本地攻击者可访问存储的配置文件，通过分析弱加密数据还原出明文密码，进而获取目标 FTP 服务器的访问权限。该漏洞影响 FTPx FTP Explorer 1.0.00.10 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备对受影响系统的本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0214"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 FTP Explorer 1.0.00.10，其加密算法过于简单（使用 XOR 或类似弱算法），存储的 FTP 密码可被轻易逆向还原。建议迁移至支持强加密存储的 FTP 客户端，如 FileZilla（免费开源，支持主密码加密凭据库）或 WinSCP（支持 AES 加密存储站点凭据）。如暂时无法更换客户端，切勿在软件中保存任何 FTP 密码，改为每次手动输入，并在操作系统层面限制该程序所在目录的访问权限（仅允许 Administrators 组读取）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1003","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.10002242035500.30645-100000%40unreal.sekure.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19762","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0214.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0214","https://github.com/nbrito/research/blob/f070ce78f917d962de8df74cc7a841f1cbbcfa00/cve/CVE-2000-0214/main.c","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0214.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0214.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5m3-8qfv-wr54/GHSA-c5m3-8qfv-wr54.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1003/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0214.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0189.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0189.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0189.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0187","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0212","title":"Pragma Systems InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pragma Systems InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可向目标 TelnetD 服务发送特制的畸形终端客户端配置信息，导致服务进程崩溃，无法正常处理后续连接请求。该漏洞利用难度较低，无需身份认证即可触发，影响运行了 InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 版本的服务器系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0212"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14Z","remediation":"升级 Pragma InterAccess TelnetD Server 至 4.0 以上版本以修复此漏洞；如厂商已停止支持该产品，建议迁移至现代 Telnet/SSH 服务器（如 OpenSSH）。在无法立即升级或迁移的情况下，通过防火墙（如 iptables）限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 Telnet 端口（23/TCP），并使用 TCP Wrappers（hosts.allow/hosts.deny）进行访问控制拦截恶意连接请求，以降低远程拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1001","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4033","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19760","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0212.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0212","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0212.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0212.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m62v-fp25-jhj4/GHSA-m62v-fp25-jhj4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0212.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001189.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a9bf5c7-b9b4-44ea-9210-9bcf151b9287.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0172","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0172.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0195","title":"Corel Linux setxconf 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 中的 setxconf 工具存在本地权限提升漏洞。当使用 -T 参数运行时，setxconf 会执行用户指定的 .xserverrc 文件，由于未对文件来源和内容进行安全检查，本地低权限用户可通过创建恶意 .xserverrc 文件并配合 setxconf -T 参数触发该漏洞，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Corel Linux OS 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0195"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11Z","remediation":"建议立即移除 setxconf 的 setuid 权限：以 root 身份执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/setxconf`，阻止普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序。同时删除不受信任用户的 ~/.xserverrc 文件。由于 Corel Linux 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议迁移至仍受支持的主流 Linux 发行版（如 Ubuntu LTS 或 Debian）以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0323.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1008","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19765","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0195.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0195","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0195.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0195.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2q3f-g73p-pfc8/GHSA-2q3f-g73p-pfc8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0195.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--03659029-215b-4170-af2d-3203f95ccafe.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0172.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0172.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0172.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0171","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0171.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0194","title":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 buildxconfig 本地任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 的 buildxconf 工具存在任意文件写入漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 `-x` 或 `-f` 参数传入特制路径，以 root 权限创建或修改系统任意文件，导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 Corel Linux OS 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地 shell 访问权限，利用方式简单，无需认证即可实施提权攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0194"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载或移除 Corel Linux OS 1.0 中 buildxconfig 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/buildxconfig），防止本地用户通过 -x 或 -f 参数任意写文件。最根本的修复是升级到受支持的 Linux 发行版（如 Ubuntu/Debian），因 Corel Linux 已停止维护且不再发布安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0323.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1007","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19764","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0194.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0194","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0194.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0194.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58wc-vc65-8m9v/GHSA-58wc-vc65-8m9v.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0194.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a8df9188-433b-4932-8107-b720e82aaa9c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0171.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0194","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0194.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0219","title":"Red Hat Linux 6.0 单用户模式权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.0 的单用户模式身份验证存在安全绕过漏洞。本地攻击者可在系统引导进入单用户模式时，在密码提示符处按下 Ctrl+C 中断验证流程，从而绕过 root 密码认证直接获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.0 版本，攻击者需具备物理或控制台访问权限才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0219"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15Z","remediation":"在 LILO 配置文件 /etc/lilo.conf 中添加 `restricted` 和 `password=密码` 选项，然后运行 `lilo` 重新加载配置；或在 /etc/inittab 中将单用户模式行修改为 `~~:S:wait:/sbin/sulogin` 强制要求密码认证。如无法立即修改，可在 BIOS 设置中禁止从软盘/CDROM 引导并启用引导密码作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1005","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200002230248.NAA19185%40cairo.anu.edu.au","https://kc.mcafee.com/corporate/index?page=content&id=SB10053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19763","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0219.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0219.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0219","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0219.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0219.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g249-hvwf-7935/GHSA-g249-hvwf-7935.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0219.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/redhat_single_user_mode.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0194.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0194.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0188","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0213","title":"Sambar Server 4.2 Beta 7 CGI 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.2 Beta 7 的 CGI 目录下默认包含 ECHO.BAT 和 HELLO.BAT 两个批处理文件，由于未对用户输入进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过向这些 CGI 脚本提交包含 Shell 元字符（如管道符、重定向符等）的特制请求，在服务器端执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Sambar Server 4.2 Beta 7 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致服务器敏感信息泄露或完全受控。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0213"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14Z","remediation":"删除 Sambar Server CGI 目录下的 ECHO.BAT 和 HELLO.BAT 文件，并禁止在 CGI 参数中使用 shell 元字符（如 `|`、`&`、`;`）。建议升级到 4.2 正式版或更高版本（如 5.0+），并在 IIS 反向代理或网络防火墙上限制对 CGI 目录的访问作为临时缓解。若无法升级，考虑迁移至维护中的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx）以彻底规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.sambar.com/session/highlight?url=/syshelp/history.htm&words=security+&color=red","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1002","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38B3E60A.6A84FEC3%40cybcom.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19761","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0213.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0213","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0213.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0213.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p8m8-3mxm-p2q7/GHSA-p8m8-3mxm-p2q7.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/sambar_cgi.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0213.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--45a71ecf-aa37-43fe-8414-dc0a69aa44ec.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0188.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0188.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0188.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0160","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0182","title":"iPlanet Web Server 4.1 HTTP GET 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"iPlanet Web Server 4.1 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标服务器发送大量 HTTP GET 请求，消耗服务器大量内存资源导致系统内核崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响 iPlanet Web Server 4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，攻击复杂度低且无需特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0182"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10Z","remediation":"升级 iPlanet Web Server 至 4.1 Service Pack 1 或更高版本，该版本已限制单连接最大并发请求数。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或负载均衡设备（如 Apache/Nginx），配置 `limit_req` 模块限制单 IP 请求速率；同时在操作系统层面调整连接跟踪表大小（`net.ipv4.netfilter.ip_conntrack_max`），防止洪泛请求耗尽内核内存触发 panic。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0182","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0182.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0182.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0182","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/f062df8a5412a76a95d44f7da2bbd67931250d17/2000/CVE-2000-0182.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v995-gr75-87rq/GHSA-v995-gr75-87rq.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0182.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88283/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0182.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0160.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0160.toml"}]